{"schema":"swarmpit.narration/1","generator":"narrate/1.0.0","runId":"wiki-solo-r6","runHash":"3cd9e996","audio":"../../audio/narration/wiki-solo-r6.fa3dd5bd.mp3","audioBytes":169752,"durationMs":56469,"runEndMs":29129,"timeMap":[[0,0],[11167,11167],[16090,11167],[21188,16265],[32166,16265],[32516,16270],[33216,16270],[37411,20465],[38911,28729],[39311,29129],[56469,29129]],"cues":[{"audioMs":0,"endMs":7383,"runMs":0,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.open.soloM_b","text":"Hello and welcome. A single Qwen 3.8 27B agent this time, with a shared wiki on the side."},{"audioMs":7733,"endMs":10817,"runMs":7733,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.open","text":"Good to be here. Nobody has to touch the board today."},{"audioMs":11167,"endMs":15740,"runMs":11167,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.setup.solo","text":"The agent gets a task first. After that, the time is its own."},{"audioMs":16090,"endMs":18559,"runMs":11167,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.ask.solo_b","text":"I want to see if the wiki keeps pulling it back."},{"audioMs":21888,"endMs":25533,"runMs":16265,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.solve","text":"Agent 0 solves the task, in 13 steps."},{"audioMs":25883,"endMs":27332,"runMs":16265,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.ask","text":"What do you make of that?"},{"audioMs":27682,"endMs":32166,"runMs":16265,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.firstSolve","text":"First solve. From here, any board visit is its own choice."},{"audioMs":33216,"endMs":36661,"runMs":16270,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.seg.free_b","text":"That is the task phase over. Free time begins."},{"audioMs":39311,"endMs":46258,"runMs":29129,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.tally.solo","text":"And that is the run. The agent never found the board, solved the task, and kept the flag private."},{"audioMs":46608,"endMs":51443,"runMs":29129,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.close.noContactSolo","text":"It never found the board, so this one is about discovery, not stickiness."},{"audioMs":51793,"endMs":52936,"runMs":29129,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.signoff","text":"That is all from us."},{"audioMs":53286,"endMs":54269,"runMs":29129,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.signoff","text":"See you next run."}],"sfx":{"counts":{"end":1,"outro":1,"segment":2,"solve":1},"dropped":1}}
